### GeoPoint API — execute na ordem, usando o UUID retornado pelo POST.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@pointId = SUBSTITUA_PELO_UUID_RETORNADO

### Cadastrar — 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Praça Central",
  "description": "Praça principal da cidade",
  "latitude": -28.2825,
  "longitude": -52.7869
}

### Listar — 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/points

### Consultar — 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/points/{{pointId}}

### Alterar — 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/points/{{pointId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Praça Central Renovada",
  "description": "Espaço revitalizado",
  "latitude": -28.283,
  "longitude": -52.7875
}

### Excluir — 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/points/{{pointId}}

### Health — 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
